{
  "changelog": "geoskill-interactive-webgis 1.0.0\n\n- Initial release: generates a self-contained, lightweight interactive WebGIS platform using Leaflet.\n- Supports click-to-query of POI points and browser-side raster elevation nearest-neighbor queries.\n- Attribute query engine with six operators (gt, lt, ge, le, eq, contains), plus point density raster aggregation.\n- No backend required; runs fully offline, including a synthetic data mode for demo/testing.\n- Outputs HTML app, embedded raster/POI data (JSON), GeoJSON features, density raster (GeoTIFF), and manifest.\n- All processing is local; user privacy is preserved by default.",
